---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import StartHere from '../components/StartHere.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { INTAKE_URL, PORTAL_URL, PRICING, RETAINER, RETAINER_APPLY_URL } from '../config/site';

const services = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'Custom Itineraries',
    body: 'Trips designed around how you actually want to travel, not a template with your name on it. I learn what matters to you: pace, preferences, the experiences you crave. Then I build something that feels like yours.',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Hotels and Resorts',
    body: "Preferred partner rates, room upgrades, resort credits, and the perks that actually matter. I work with the world's best properties to get you benefits you can't get booking on your own.",
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Reservations and Access',
    body: 'The restaurant that\'s "fully booked." The private tour that\'s not on the website. The experience that requires knowing who to ask. Some doors just open when you have the right connections.',
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    title: 'Destination Expertise',
    body: "Not sure where to go? I research destinations obsessively: the right season, the right neighborhood, the property worth choosing. Tell me what you're in the mood for and I'll find places that deliver.",
  },
  {
    n: '05',
    title: 'Group Travel',
    body: 'Planning with friends, family, or colleagues? I coordinate the logistics so everyone gets what they want: separate bookings, group dining, activities that work for different interests. All without the usual headaches.',
  },
  {
    n: '06',
    title: 'Special Occasions',
    body: 'Honeymoons, anniversaries, milestone birthdays, proposals. Some trips need to be flawless. I handle the pressure so you can focus on the moment.',
  },
];
---

<Layout title="Services" description="Premium travel planning for discerning travelers. Custom itineraries, luxury hotels with exclusive perks, and reservations you can't get on your own. Certified Fora travel advisor.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Services" intro="The best hotels. The impossible reservations. The upgrades that just happen. As a certified Fora travel advisor with a background in luxury hospitality, I take care of the details so your trip actually delivers on the promise.">
    Everything, <em>handled.</em>
  </PageHero>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-14 md:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-5">
        <p class="eyebrow">What I offer</p>
        <h2 class="display-lg">Premium travel planning <em>for people who know the difference.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-2 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          services.map((s) => (
            <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-sand-300 py-9">
              <span class="font-display text-[22px] text-clay">{s.n}</span>
              <h3 class="text-[32px] leading-tight">{s.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-ink-600">{s.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="bg-sand-200 py-24 md:py-28" id="process">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-6 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:col-span-4 lg:self-start">
        <p class="eyebrow">The process</p>
        <h2 class="display-lg">How it <em>works.</em></h2>
        <p class="text-ink-700">A straightforward approach to planning your next trip. No surprises, just thoughtful collaboration, with everything in one client portal.</p>
        <a href={INTAKE_URL} class="btn-primary mt-2 self-start" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Start Planning <Icon name="arrow" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" /></a>
      </div>
      <ol class="flex flex-col gap-5 lg:col-span-8">
        <li class="reveal grid gap-4 rounded-card bg-sand-50 p-8 sm:grid-cols-[96px_1fr] md:p-10">
          <span class="font-display text-[56px] leading-none text-clay">01</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-[32px] leading-tight">Discovery</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-600">Start with a short intake so I know who's traveling, where you're based, and the hotels you already love. Then we talk about where you want to go, how you like to travel, and what makes a trip feel worth it. No commitment, just exploration.</p>
            <a href={INTAKE_URL} class="link-accent self-start text-[15px]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Begin the Intake</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal grid gap-4 rounded-card bg-sand-50 p-8 sm:grid-cols-[96px_1fr] md:p-10">
          <span class="font-display text-[56px] leading-none text-clay">02</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-[32px] leading-tight">Design</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-600">Based on our conversation, I put together the properties, dining, and experiences. All tailored to what actually matters to you.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal grid gap-4 rounded-card bg-pine p-8 text-cream-100 sm:grid-cols-[96px_1fr] md:p-10">
          <span class="font-display text-[56px] leading-none text-gold">03</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-[32px] leading-tight">Refine and Book</h3>
            <p class="text-pine-muted">We refine the plan together until it feels exactly right. Hotels are browsed and booked in your private Wyld Wandering client portal, powered by Fora, with the perks attached.</p>
            <a href={PORTAL_URL} class="self-start text-[15px] font-medium text-gold underline-offset-4 hover:text-gold-soft hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Client Portal</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal grid gap-4 rounded-card bg-sand-50 p-8 sm:grid-cols-[96px_1fr] md:p-10">
          <span class="font-display text-[56px] leading-none text-clay">04</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-[32px] leading-tight">Depart</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-600">I handle the reservations and logistics. Throughout your trip, I'm available for support and can help pivot plans if needed.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-28 py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-14">
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
          <h2 class="display-lg">Planning <em>fee.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-md text-ink-700">Fees depend on the scope of work, and hotel-only bookings are complimentary. Planning fees are due at booking and are non-refundable. Multi-country trips and events are quoted individually.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
        {
          PRICING.map((tier) => (
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card border border-sand-300 p-8">
              <span class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-600">{tier.name}</span>
              <span class="flex h-[48px] items-end font-display font-medium leading-none"><span class:list={[tier.price.length > 10 ? "text-[34px]" : "text-[48px]"]}>{tier.price}</span></span>
              <p class="text-ink-700">{tier.detail}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <div id="retainer" class="reveal grid scroll-mt-28 gap-10 rounded-card bg-pine p-8 text-cream-100 md:p-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-gold">For frequent travelers</p>
          <h3 class="text-[40px] leading-tight">{RETAINER.name}</h3>
          <p class="font-display text-[56px] font-medium leading-none">{RETAINER.amount}<span class="font-sans text-lg font-light text-pine-muted"> per year</span></p>
          <p class="text-pine-muted">{RETAINER.billing}</p>
          <a href={RETAINER_APPLY_URL} class="btn-primary mt-2 self-start">Apply for the Retainer</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid content-start gap-x-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7">
          {
            RETAINER.includes.map((item) => (
              <li class="border-t border-cream-100/15 py-4 text-cream-100">{item}</li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid gap-10 text-[18px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-700 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <p>This covers everything: the research, the recommendations, the bookings, and the back-and-forth until we get it right. It also covers what happens after you book. I'm your point of contact if anything changes, if something goes sideways, or if you just want a second opinion on which restaurant is actually worth the reservation.</p>
        <p>The fee is separate from the perks you get by booking through me. Upgrades, resort credits, early check-in, and preferred rates come through my relationships with hotels and suppliers. You'd pay the same room rate booking direct, but you wouldn't get any of that.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card bg-sand-200 p-8 md:p-10">
          <h3 class="text-[30px] leading-tight">Referrals</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-700">If you refer someone to me and they book a trip, your planning fee is waived on your next booking. Good travel advice is worth sharing, and I'd rather reward you for it than spend that money on advertising.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card bg-sand-200 p-8 md:p-10">
          <h3 class="text-[30px] leading-tight">A Retainer Year on Me</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-700">{RETAINER.invite} By then, I know how you like to travel, and you know what you're getting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="reveal max-w-3xl font-display text-[28px] font-medium leading-snug md:text-[32px]">
        If you're looking for someone to forward confirmation emails, I'm probably not the right fit. If you want someone who knows the difference between a good hotel and a well-marketed one, <em class="font-normal italic text-clay">let's talk.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StartHere />
</Layout>
